      "FunctionSignature": "DSCore.Color.ByARGB@int,int,int,int",
      "Replication": "Auto",
      "Description": "Construct a color by alpha, red, green, and blue components.\n\nColor.ByARGB (alpha: int = 255, red: int = 0, green: int = 0, blue: int = 0): Color"
